{"strongs": "H8217", "word": "שָׁפָל", "translit": "sha.phal", "root": "שפל", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "low", "definition": "שָׁפָל adjective low ; — absolute ׳ שׁ 2Sam 6:22 +, construct שְׁפַל Ps 29:23 +; feminine singular שְׁפָלָה Ezek 17:14 +, construct שִׁפְלַת v Ezek 17:6 plural שְׁפָלִים Job 5:11 — 1. low , in height, of vine Ezek 17:6 , tree v Ezek 17:24 (opposed to גָּבֹהַּ ); מִןהָֿעוֺר ׳ שׁ Lev 13:20 lower (deeper) than the skin (around it), so v Lev 13:21 v Lev 13:26 , compare Lev 14:37 . 2. of a modest, unambitious kingdom Ezek 17:14 ; Ezek 29:14 ; Ezek 29:15 low in station Job 5:11 (opposed to שָֽׂגְבוּ ), Ezek 21:31 ( Ges «GKC:90f»§ 90f .; read הַשְּׁפָלָה֣ ). 3. humiliated , בְּעֵינָ֑י ׳ שׁ 2Sam 6:22 plural Mal 2:9 (|| נִבְזִים ). 4. lowly , as substantive Ps 138:6 (opposed to גָּבֹהַּ ), רוּחַ שְׁפָלִים Isa 57:15 (|| נִדְכָּ אִים ); שְׁפַל רוּחַ v Isa 57:15 , Prov 29:23 (opposed to גַּאֲוַת אָדָם ), + Prov 16:19 Thes and others (but see check Qal 2 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8968')\">BDB8968</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8217')\">H8217</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8967')\">BDB8967</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8969')\">BDB8969</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׁפָל</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>low</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,22)\">2Sam 6:22</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>שְׁפַל</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ps 29:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,23)\">Ps 29:23</ref> +; feminine singular <bdbheb>שְׁפָלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,14)\">Ezek 17:14</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>שִׁפְלַת</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 17:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17